# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SPAR Option A — Multi-provider FREE API setup for Quorum
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy sections you want into your main `.env` file (never commit real keys).
#
# Quorum slots you can use AT THE SAME TIME:
#   • GOOGLE (native)        — Gemini
#   • OPENROUTER             — 20+ free models (DeepSeek, Llama, Qwen, etc.)
#   • QUORUM_EXTRA_PROVIDERS — Groq + DeepSeek + Together + … (many at once)
#   • CUSTOM (one URL)       — legacy single-slot fallback
#   • OLLAMA (auto)          — local fallback
#
# Model ID formats:
#   OpenRouter:  meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free
#   Google:      gemini-2.5-flash
#   Extra APIs:  groq:llama-3.3-70b-versatile  deepseek:deepseek-chat
#   Ollama:      ollama:qwen2.5:7b
#
# Brief cloud test:
#   uv run python examples/spar_cloud_brief_test.py --list-providers
#   uv run python examples/spar_cloud_brief_test.py --validate-preset multi-provider-free
#   uv run python examples/spar_cloud_brief_test.py --preset multi-provider-free
#
# Default hybrid stack (multi-provider-free):
#   Political        -> github:openai/gpt-4.1
#   Economic         -> qwencloud:qwen-plus
#   Environmental    -> ollama:granite3.3:8b  (only offline model)
#   Social           -> gemini-2.5-flash
#   DevilsAdvocate   -> groq:llama-3.3-70b-versatile
#   Moderator        -> qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct:free  (OpenRouter)

# ── Core Quorum (keep these) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
QUORUM_EXECUTION_MODE=sequential
QUORUM_MODEL_TIMEOUT=180
QUORUM_REPORT_DIR=~/spar_outputs

# ── 1. Google AI Studio (FREE — best frontier-ish free tier) ───────────────
# Sign up: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey  (same Google login, NOT gemini.google.com chat)
# Limits: ~15 RPM, ~1,500 requests/day on Flash (varies by model)
# SPAR agent suggestion: Environmental or Economic
GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_ai_studio_key_here
GOOGLE_MODELS=gemini-2.5-flash

# ── 2. OpenRouter (FREE — one key, many providers/models) ─────────────────
# Sign up: https://openrouter.ai/keys  (no credit card)
# Limits: ~20 RPM, ~200 requests/day free (more after $10 one-time top-up)
# Always use :free suffix or you may be charged if you add credits later
#
# SPAR agent suggestions (5 different "providers" through one key):
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your_key_here
OPENROUTER_MODELS=qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct:free,meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free

# Other strong OpenRouter :free options (swap in if one is rate-limited):
#   deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3-0324:free
#   deepseek/deepseek-r1-0528:free
#   meta-llama/llama-4-maverick:free
#   qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct:free
#   openrouter/free   (auto-picks any free model — good for Moderator only)

# ── 3. EXTRA providers — use MANY APIs at once (recommended over CUSTOM) ───
# Register any OpenAI-compatible API. Models use prefix: groq:model-name
#
QUORUM_EXTRA_PROVIDERS=groq,qwencloud,github
#
# Groq (FREE — fast) — DevilsAdvocate in multi-provider-free
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_key_here
# GROQ_MODELS=llama-3.3-70b-versatile
#
# Qwen Cloud / DashScope (international compatible mode) — Economic agent
# QWENCLOUD_API_KEY=sk-ws-your_qwen_cloud_key
# QWENCLOUD_MODELS=qwen-plus
#
# GitHub Models (free PAT with models:read; retires July 30, 2026) — Political agent
# GITHUB_API_KEY=github_pat_your_token
# GITHUB_MODELS=openai/gpt-4.1
#
# DeepSeek DIRECT (skip if no balance)
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-your_deepseek_key_here
# DEEPSEEK_MODELS=deepseek-chat
#
# Together AI
# TOGETHER_API_KEY=your_together_key
# TOGETHER_MODELS=meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct-Turbo
# TOGETHER_BASE_URL=https://api.together.xyz/v1
#
# Mistral La Plateforme
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=your_mistral_key
# MISTRAL_MODELS=mistral-small-latest
#
# Cerebras (FREE tier)
# CEREBRAS_API_KEY=your_cerebras_key
# CEREBRAS_MODELS=llama-3.3-70b
#
# Any other host — add key to QUORUM_EXTRA_PROVIDERS and set {KEY}_API_KEY,
# {KEY}_BASE_URL, {KEY}_MODELS (KEY = uppercase provider name).

# ── 4. CUSTOM slot — legacy single extra URL (use EXTRA providers instead) ─

# Option A: Groq (FREE, very fast — no credit card)
# Sign up: https://console.groq.com/keys
# Limits: ~30 RPM, ~1,000 requests/day
# CUSTOM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# CUSTOM_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_key_here
# CUSTOM_MODELS=llama-3.3-70b-versatile

# Option B: DeepSeek DIRECT (signup grant, NOT permanent free)
# Sign up: https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys
# New accounts: ~5M tokens free for 30 days, no credit card
# After grant: pay-as-you-go (~$0.14/M tokens — very cheap)
# CUSTOM_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
# CUSTOM_API_KEY=sk-your_deepseek_key_here
# CUSTOM_MODELS=deepseek-chat

# Option C: Mistral La Plateforme (FREE experiment tier)
# Sign up: https://console.mistral.ai/api-keys
# Limits: ~1 req/s, ~500K TPM / ~1B tokens/month on free experiment plan
# CUSTOM_BASE_URL=https://api.mistral.ai/v1
# CUSTOM_API_KEY=your_mistral_key_here
# CUSTOM_MODELS=mistral-small-latest

# Option D: Cerebras (FREE, very fast)
# Sign up: https://cloud.cerebras.ai/
# Limits: ~30 RPM, ~1M tokens/day
# CUSTOM_BASE_URL=https://api.cerebras.ai/v1
# CUSTOM_API_KEY=your_cerebras_key_here
# CUSTOM_MODELS=llama-3.3-70b

# ── Paid APIs (optional — only if you add billing later) ───────────────────
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODELS=gpt-4o-mini
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODELS=claude-sonnet-4-20250514
